  "mathematical_scope": [
    "Any certified positive endpoint source at an actual negative root is some of the same negative index: ambient equality is excluded by strict interior endpoints; actual closed-negative uniqueness identifies the index.",
    "The two stored root fields are actual closedComponentField germs, with the opposite positive side selected explicitly. No transport equality is assumed at the root.",
    "Full iterated Frechet derivatives of the constructed positive map through n+1 and height through n agree with the genuine whole negative fields, including zero order.",
    "The final actual constructor has exactly the original finite raw endpoint bounds and reuses the same Clog, Msigma, delta, coordinate/height functions and reference identity. The public intermediate adapter also consumes the existing factory output for later polynomial-factory reuse."
